:::text id=slide7_title x=80 y=95 w=929 h=64 preset=title align=left color=text fontSize=40
# Rules of Engagement — Pet Peeves & Golden Rules
:::

:::shape id=slide7_card1 x=80 y=175 w=450 h=430 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=slide7_icon1 name=thumbs-down x=104 y=195 w=32 h=32 color=#0891B2
:::

:::text id=slide7_text1 x=104 y=235 w=400 h=350 preset=body align=left color=text
**Pet Peeves (What to Avoid):**

• **Unscheduled communication:** Avoid unscheduled calls or check-ins for non-urgent matters.

• **Refusal of ideas:** Avoid Refusal of ideas or proposals without clear explanations.
:::

:::shape id=slide7_card2 x=550 y=175 w=459 h=430 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=slide7_icon2 name=star x=574 y=195 w=32 h=32 color=#0891B2
:::

:::text id=slide7_text2 x=574 y=235 w=410 h=350 preset=body align=left color=text
**Golden Rules (Best Practices):**

• **Notify me beforehand:** Notify me beforehand for synchronous check-ins.

• **Give reasons:** Give reasons for idea/proposal refusal, and suggest alternatives.
:::